</element-citation><mixed-citation id="mc-CR12" publication-type="journal">Wells JA, Glassman AR, Ayala AR, et al. Aflibercept, bevacizumab, or ranibizumab for diabetic macular edema: two-year results from a comparative effectiveness randomized clinical trial. Ophthalmology. 2016;123(6):1351&#x02013;9. 10.1016/j.ophtha.2016.02.022.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">26935357</pub-id>
