</element-citation><mixed-citation id="mc-CR13" publication-type="journal">Schmidt-Erfurth U, Garcia-Arumi J, Bandello F, et al. Guidelines for the management of diabetic macular edema by the european society of retina specialists (EURETINA). Ophthalmologica. 2017;237(4):185&#x02013;222. 10.1159/000458539.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">28423385</pub-id>
